3DSpotify

3DSpotify is an unofficial, independent project. It is not affiliated with,
endorsed by, sponsored by or in any way associated with Spotify AB or any of
its subsidiaries. Spotify is a trademark of Spotify AB; it is used here only
to describe the service this client connects to.

This project includes code from SpotiBacan
(https://github.com/ohquebacan/spotibacan) by ohquebacan
(https://github.com/ohquebacan). The following parts of this repository
originate from that project and have been modified for 3DSpotify:

  - source/platform3ds/
  - source/probe_ap/
  - source/probe_audio/
  - source/probe_meta/
  - source/probe_pair/
  - source/probe_play/
  - source/probe_tls/
  - source/build.py

All credit for the original work in those files goes to ohquebacan.

